  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 10a88b719ae354d34a36fc6102014aa3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  plainTextCipher: "In the year six hundred and twenty two, I was given the incredible
    privilege of accompanying His Majesty, King PLACEHOLDER, First of His Name, Lord
    of the Crowned Lands and Protector of All Beneath the Sun, on his noble campaign
    to slay the Demon Lord who had been terrorizing our southern borders. His Majesty
    was an arrogant, self-important, and profoundly foolish man. His poor judgment
    led thousands of our kingdom\u2019s young men straight into their graves. He
    had invited me to document his valor and cunning, so that generations to come
    could learn of his military genius. I only hope that whoever finds this account
    will remember the sacrifice of those who fought a pointless war. He cannot be
    beaten."
